		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "b1911854-5b90-4d3b-86b0-4b50ae3cf2dc")
		(at 145.1 56.7 180)
		(descr "Front-panel link (JP21 / front JP3): Wurth WR-MM 690367181672, Micro-MaTch-compatible female PCB connector, 16 contacts, 1.27 mm staggered (2.54 mm per row, rows 2.54 mm apart), vertical THT, 1.5 A 250 VAC. The latch of the cable plug enters the 1.5 mm non-plated hole beside pin 1, which locks the plug and sets its direction. From Wurth drawing 690367181672 rev 002.000 (2021-08-18): 0.85 +/-0.10 mm holes, pl = 19.05 mm from pin 1 to pin 16, body L = 22.32 x 5 mm, 6.1 mm tall, and the 1.50 mm latch hole 1.40 mm beyond pin 1 and 1.80 mm towards the even row. Drawn in the maker's top view: odd pins in the north row with pin 1 at the east end, even pins 2.54 mm south.")
